### Создание заявки на кредит
POST http://localhost:8080/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanAmount": 600000,
  "termMonths": 60,
  "monthlyIncome": 100000,
  "currentCreditLoad": 10000,
  "creditRating": 750
}

### Получение статуса заявки
GET http://localhost:8080/api/loans/1
Accept: application/json

### Создание заявки с высокой кредитной нагрузкой
POST http://localhost:8080/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanAmount": 1200000,
  "termMonths": 60,
  "monthlyIncome": 50000,
  "currentCreditLoad": 20000,
  "creditRating": 650
}

### Проверка статуса второй заявки
GET http://localhost:8080/api/loans/2
Accept: application/json
